{"id":"meeting","lemma":"Meeting","pos":"noun","rank":2280,"glosses":["a business meeting; a scheduled formal meeting for a specific purpose or with an agenda"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/61/De-Meeting.ogg/De-Meeting.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Meetings","plural":"Meetings"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir haben ein Meeting.","en":"We have a meeting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/698443","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Das Meeting beginnt um drei.","en":"The meeting begins at three.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to begin","l":"beginnen"},{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"three (numerical value…"}]},{"text":"Du hättest zum Meeting gehen sollen.","en":"You should have attended the meeting.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"to go, to walk"},{"g":"should"}]},{"text":"Er schwieg während des Meetings.","en":"He remained silent during the meeting.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"silence","l":"Schweigen"},{"g":"while"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Das Meeting fand gestern statt.","en":"The meeting took place yesterday.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to find","l":"finden"},{"g":"yesterday"},{"g":"instead of"}]}]}